<article class="seo-content" style="margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);">
  <h2>9 大国际连锁酒店集团积分规则与估值基准</h2>
  <p>各集团在积分兑换规则、全积分房度假村费（Resort Fees）免除政策以及连住免费房晚机制上存在显著差异。以下为官方条款审核与典型研究基准：</p>

  <div class="hotel-table-container">
    <table class="hotel-comparison-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>酒店集团</th>
          <th>典型估值基准</th>
          <th>连住免费房晚政策</th>
          <th>全积分房度假村费</th>
          <th>官方条款来源</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for prog in hotelPrograms %}
        <tr>
          <td><strong>{{ prog.nameZh }}</strong></td>
          <td>{{ prog.valuationScenarioUsdCents }}¢ (约¥{{ prog.valuationScenarioCny }})</td>
          <td>{{ prog.eligibilityNoteZh }}</td>
          <td>
            {% if "免除" in prog.resortFeeNoteZh %}
            <span class="policy-badge waived">全积分免除</span>
            {% elseif "不免除" in prog.resortFeeNoteZh %}
            <span class="policy-badge charged">不免除</span>
            {% else %}
            <span class="policy-badge varies">视酒店而定</span>
            {% endif %}
            <div style="font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px;">{{ prog.resortFeeNoteZh }}</div>
          </td>
          <td>
            {% if prog.officialSourceUrl %}
            <a href="{{ prog.officialSourceUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="program-source-link">{{ prog.officialSourceName }}</a>
            {% else %}
            <span style="color: var(--muted);">用户输入</span>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  
  <h2>相关深度指南与对比</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/compare/">各大酒店集团与信用卡常客计划积分价值横向对比</a></li>
